  {
    //Introduction
    "Introduction": "Thank you once again for saving me! I believe introductions are due. My name is Ryden.#$e#I am honored to meet you!$h",
    //Resort
    "Resort_Entering": "It'll be nice to relax on solid ground for a change.#$e#Variety is the spice of life!$h",
    "Resort_Leaving": "It's about time I get back to the waters.",
    "Resort_Wander": "I wonder if I could catch some fish for the fellow patrons...",
    "Resort_Wander_2": "The sensation of warm sand under my feet is unlike any other.",
    "Resort_Shore": "It's not often I get to gaze out upon these waters from above. They really are stunning!",
    "Resort_Chair": "Are you enjoying yourself, @? I must admit, you aren't exactly dressed for the occasion...",
    "Resort_Towel": "I have to find time to catch a tan on my new legs!",
    "Resort_Towel_2": "Whew... are you humans always out in the sun without any water to cool you off?$3",
    "Resort_Bar": "Have you ever had a mocktail? It's like classy fruit juice!",
    "Resort": "The island breeze on my skin feels so refreshing!$h",
    //Dating Shenanigans
    "danceRejection": "Oh, uh... I'd rather not. My apologies.$s",
    "divorced": "I'm not interested in entertaining you any longer.$7#$e#Leave me alone.$s",
    "dumped_Guys": "What else do you want from me?$a",
    "secondChance_Guys": "Even after everything... I'm willing to try and make this work.$s",
    "breakUp": "Among humans, this is a sign of terminating a relationship, is it not?$s#$b#...I see. Well, if that's what you wish, so be it.$7",
    //Spring Dialogue
      ////Monday
      "Mon": "...Interested in my luscious locks, are you?#$e#...Merman's secret!$h",
      "Mon6": "*whistles* Looking nice today, @!$h#$b#This spring weather is doing wonders for your skin, you know.",
      ////Tuesday
      "Tue": "I'd do anything for a nice sushi roll...$s#$b#What? Oh, nothing. Just thinking about what's for dinner, is all.",
      "Tue4": "The human world can feel overwhelming at times. I'm glad I have such a good friend by my side.",
      ////Wednesday
      "Wed": "Sometimes, when I'm on land, I can still feel the waves rocking me.#$e#Need something?$3",
      "Wed4": "The Stardrop Saloon has truly become my happy place.#$b#I love the games, and the people, and the conversations, but most of all, I love the smell!$h#$b#Come see me there sometime, and dinner's on me. I promise!",
      ////Thursday
      "Thu": "My friend Sonia spends *all* of her time training. It's ridiculous!$3#$b#$q 1844305/1844306 activityquestion_followup#I'd love to get her into a new hobby... tell me, @, what's some activity I can recommend her?#$r 1844305 0 activityquestion_cooking#What about cooking?#$r 1844306 30 activityquestion_reading#You should get her into historical fiction.#$r 1844305 0 activityquestion_farming#Farming!",
      "activityquestion_followup": "#$p 1844305#I'd do anything to get her out of this combat obsession...$s|If only I could get her to enjoy something else...$s",
      "activityquestion_cooking": "Cooking?!$6#$b#If she learns to make her own food, she wouldn't want me to gift her food anymore...$s#$b#That would be so sad!$6",
      "activityquestion_reading": "Historical fiction...?$3#$b#What a wonderful idea!$h#$b#She's so interested in fighting, surely I could pique her interest in a war novel or two... thank you, @!",
      "activityquestion_farming": "Somehow, I knew you'd say that...$3#$b#Unfortunately, she doesn't exactly seem like the earthy type.$s",
      "Thu8": "You should come hang out with me in my room sometime.#$b#The castle is a little... regal for my tastes, but I'd love to get some time alone with you.",
      ////Friday
      "Fri": "I sleep inside an anemone. There's just something so soothing about it, you know?#$b#The only downside is that I can't invite others into my bed.$s",
      "Fri4": "I hope you don't run into my dad. He's not the biggest fan of humans.$s#$e#Or of me associating with individuals he doesn't approve of.$7",
      ////Saturday
      "Sat": "What's cookin', @?#$e#I've been practicing my lingo!$h",
      "Sat6": "I've always had freckles on my fins. My dad doesn't have them, but my mom did...$s#$b#It's something to remember her by whenever I look in the mirror.",
      ////Sunday
      "Sun": "I've always wondered what it might be like to fly.#$b#I've conquered the seas, I'm conquering the lands...soon all that's left will be to conquer the skies.",
      "Sun6": "It often feels like the whole world is looking to you for guidance when you're a prince.#$e#I get so sick of it sometimes...$7#$b#I never feel that way when I'm with you, though.$4",
      ////Specific Days
      "spring_12_2": "The talk around town is that the Egg Festival is tomorrow.#$b#I hope you have fun, I really do... but frankly, I am quite bewildered by humans' festive traditions.$u#$b#I mean, hunting eggs... how ridiculous!$h",
      "spring_26": "The waters are finally beginning to warm up again. This used to be the time of year when all the merchildren would swim up to visit the surface.#$b#Oh, how I miss that feeling of innocent, childlike wonder...$s",
    //Summer Dialogue
      ////Monday
      "summer_Mon": "Sometimes I wonder what all the townspeople would say if they found out I was a merman.#$b#Would they be shocked? Scared? Intrigued? Enticed?$u#$b#If I was a human and I found out the cute boy next door was a merman, I'd be pretty interested, personally.$h",
      ////Tuesday
      "summer_Tue": "This heat is unbearable! When it gets warm underwater, all I have to do is swim downward, but up on the surface...$s#$b#I feel like I'm getting baked!$6",
      ////Wednesday
      "summer_Wed": "Hey, @!$h#$b#Here's a fun fact for you: most merpeople's ear fins are a bit ticklish.#$b#Don't go getting any ideas, now!$h",
      "summer_Wed6": "Checking out my abs? That's what you get when you spend all day swimming!$h#$e#You know, maybe you and I should go for a swim sometime soon.",
      ////Thursday
      "summer_Thu": "...Hay there.#$b#Get it? It's a farming pun!$h",
      "summer_Thu4": "@... do you think a dress would look flattering on me?$u#$b#I've only been regularly wearing clothes since I started hanging around in the human world. I want to experiment - find what makes me feel like the best version of myself!$h#$b#Personally... I think I'd look pretty dashing in some drapes.",
      ////Friday
      "summer_Fri": "People aren't made to sit inside all day, you know.#$b#Good on you for getting out and about.$h",
      "summer_Fri6": "Before the sea monsters destroyed it, there was a theater in Malha.#$b#As a merchild, my favorite show was \"The Little Blobfish\".#$b#It's about a blobfish that spends his entire life visiting different seas, and in doing so, learns lessons about love and friendship.#$b#It always made me cry...$s",
      ////Saturday
      "summer_Sat": "Did you know that there's a trench in Malha?$u#$b#The Angler twins used to live there... I haven't seen them in a while, though.$s",
      ////Sunday
      "summer_Sun": "Were you surprised to learn that merpeople eat fish too?$u#$b#Don't be. We've got to get our protein in somehow, right?",
      ////Specific Days
      "summer_10": "Hmm... the Luau...$u#$b#It sounds fun!$h#$b#Maybe I'll bring a fresh deep sea catch or two to throw into the pot.",
      "summer_27": "If you think the moonlight jellies are beautiful from the surface, you really should see them from underwater.#$b#Looking up on them from below, they're like gorgeous blue stars and nebulae, speckling the waters above...#$b#I look forward to it every year.$h",
    //Fall Dialogue 
      ////Monday
      "fall_Mon": "Hello there, @!$h#$b#I was wondering... could you see me being on one of those cooking competition shows?$u#$e#I was just curious.$h",
      "fall_Mon4": "Oh, @! I've been looking all over for you!#$b#I was thinking... we should make a secret friend handshake!$h#$b#Sure, it might sound childish... but even as an adult, I can admit that secret handshakes are AWESOME!$h",
      ////Tuesday
      "fall_Tue": "When I was a teenager, there was this *super* trendy tail lotion making the rounds in Malha.#$b#Of course, I've always cared about looking my best, so I bought it as fast as I could and tried it...$u#$b#And it made my scales flake!$6#$b#Since then, I've been careful to always patch test my scale care products.",
      ////Wednesday
      "fall_Wed4": "Before Malha fell, some of the more modern homes had a swanky water filtration system.#$b#The air on the surface is always so clean, but water can get mucky easier than you'd think.#$b#My dad never got one installed in the castle for some reason - *economics*, he said.$12#$b#Economics my fin! He's the KING, for Alana's sake!$a",
      ////Thursday
      "fall_Thu": "Do try your best to keep the waters clean, @. Remember that Malha likely fell due to the carelessness of your kind.$11#$e#I trust you, though.$h",
      ////Friday
      "fall_Fri": "I bet you've got some nice muscles underneath those clothes from all that farming, huh?#$b#I'm just teasing you. You don't need to show me.$h",
      ////Saturday
      "fall_Sat8": "Oh... hi, @.$s#$b#This time of year is always more difficult for me than others.$s#$e#Around this time, when I was a boy... my mom died in a monster attack.$7#$b#This might sound silly, but whenever I feel upset or unsure of myself, I like to imagine what my mom would say to me.$s#$b#And somehow, it always manages to make me feel better.",
      ////Sunday
      "fall_Sun": "I've been going on hikes around the mountains to get used to having human legs.#$b#I will admit, they are a much slower method of transport than fins...$u#$b#But, oh, don't I just look stunning in joggers?$h",
      ////Specific Days
      "fall_1": "The valley looks quite attractive painted in the scarlet hues of autumn.$u#$b#We don't get such drastic shifts between seasons under the water. The surface can be truly breathtaking.",
      "fall_15": "The Fair is tomorrow..?$u#$b#Oh, how exciting!$h#$b#If I wanted, I could go into a long spiel about how it brings folks from all around the Valley together as one...#$b#But let's be frank with ourselves. We both know I'm there for the funnel cakes.$h",
    //Winter Dialogue
      ////Monday
      "winter_Mon4": "@, you know I would hate to see you down. Listen to yourself and your needs. Take breaks.#$b#And remember, if you're ever in a sour mood, you can always stop by my place and I'll take you out to eat - on me!$h",
      ////Tuesday
      "winter_Tue6": "Oh, @... you look absolutely frozen!$6#$b#A nice, friendly hug should fix you right up...#$b#See? Much better!$h",
      ////Wednesday
      "winter_Wed": "A-achoo! Ugh, this cold weather gets my sinuses all clogged up...$s#$b#Nothing a good spicy dish can't fix, right?$h",
      ////Thursday
      "winter_Thu": "Hanging around in Pelican Town reminds me of the way things used to be, before Malha fell.$s#$b#Malha was a lot bigger than this little town, of course... but the sense of tightly knit community was exactly the same.",
      ////Friday
      "winter_Fri4": "Because I like you, @, I'll let you in on a little secret.#$b#Food is the way into my heart!$h#$b#Be careful with what you put in front of me, though...$3#$b#My tastes are refined.$h",
      ////Saturday
      "winter_Sat": "Mmm, I love catching snowflakes on my tongue - it makes me feel like a kid again!$h#$b#It reminds me of when we used to catch bubbles in our mouth as children.#$b#Then, we'd have a contest to see who could collect the most air.#$b#Naturally, I always won.$h",
      "winter_Sat6": "*sigh* I always get so pale in the winter...$s#$b#I think I look best when I'm tan, don't you?",
      ////Sunday
      "winter_Sun": "I love food, of course...#$b#But if there's one thing I can't stand, it's an uncooked tomato.$12#$b#Cooked is fine, but when it's raw, with all those sweaty juices intact... ugh! I'd rather bottomfeed!$a",
    //Specific Days
    "winter_14": "I hear that traitorous snake *Jessica* is putting on her little show tomorrow at the Night Market.$12#$b#Rest assured, I will NOT be in attendance.$7",
    //Night Market Dialogue
    "winterBeachNightMarket":"Oh, hello, @.$u#$b#As you can see, I hesitantly decided to attend the Night Market, enticed by the smell of freshly ground coffee and fine art.#$b#However, I will be giving a wide berth to that sorry excuse for a show on the far side of the docks.$12#$b#If you must know, that mermaid Jessica and I have a bit of a... history.$12#$b#When Malha fell, she had the *audacity* to tell me that I was a finlicker for staying behind and defending the city, and now she's betrayed us all to sell herself out to humans!$a#$b#No matter. Malha has no use for someone like her anyway.$7",
    //Location Based
    "ArchaeologyHouse": "I find it quite entertaining to read human literature on merfolk.#$b#Mostly because you all have such absurd ideas about us!$h#$b#For one thing, why do humans seem to think all we do is sing?!$6#$b#Of course, I *do* sing rather well...$3#$b#But not because I'm a merman!$6",
    //Event Dialogue
    "food_curry":"Ah, are you a fan of spice? I am as well!$h#$b#Unfortunately, I am not prepared to make a curry today.",
    "food_bisque": "I see... very refined. You and I share tastes!$h#$b#Unfortunately, I am not prepared to make a lobster dish today.",
    "food_breakfast": "You know what they say... the most important meal of the day!$h#$b#Unfortunately, I am not prepared to make a complete breakfast today."
  }